    "comment": "Density doubled 2026-09-05 (user request) over the GD-27 baseline: a dry wing-floor now rolls 0..3 zombies (weights index = count, ~1.7 expected, was ~0.85), flooded Dark/Crush wings roll a Drowned at 0.8 (was 0.4), and open-water spacings are halved. Spacings are cell ranges walked along OPEN WATER columns only (gaps + ocean margins), not the whole world width. Pity timer per wing: every quiet floor adds wing_pity_boost to the next floor's chance of at least one spawn, and after wing_pity_floors quiet floors the next is guaranteed (when the floor can hold anything).",
